/F1 10 Tf (BIS PRODUCT CERTIFICATION SCHEMES \(CONFORMITY ASSESSMENT\)) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Overview of Scheme-I \(Marking Fee and Product Licensing Scheme\)) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (SECTION 1: PRODUCT CERTIFICATION PROCESS) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (The Product Certification Scheme of BIS aims at providing third-party guarantee of quality, safety and reliability.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Key Steps in the BIS Certification Process:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (1. Submission of Application: The manufacturer applies online on the Manakonline portal with required documents.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (2. Factory Inspection: BIS technical auditor visits manufacturing premises to verify manufacturing infrastructure.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (3. Sample Drawing and Testing: Independent testing of product samples in BIS-approved or in-house laboratories.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (4. Grant of License: License to use the Standard Mark \(ISI mark\) is granted upon satisfactory compliance.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Surveillance inspections and market samples are drawn periodically to ensure consistent quality.) Tj T*
ET
