/F2 12 Tf (SECTION 2: COMPULSORY REGISTRATION SCHEME \(CRS\)) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Under the CRS scheme notified by MeitY and DPIIT, electronics and IT goods require compulsory registration.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Key CRS Provisions:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (1. Manufacturers do not undergo pre-license factory audit but must submit test reports from BIS-recognized labs.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (2. Registration is granted for standard compliance without issuing traditional ISI physical stamp.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (3. Foreign manufacturers must appoint an Authorized Indian Representative \(AIR\).) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (SECTION 3: FOREIGN MANUFACTURERS CERTIFICATION SCHEME \(FMCS\)) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Foreign manufacturers located outside India can obtain a BIS license under FMCS Scheme.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (A separate audit of the overseas manufacturing premises is carried out by BIS inspecting officers.) Tj T*
ET
